{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented Turn 4. Removed the legacy deposit constants, functions, options, and fields. `notifyHook` receives each created booking’s total and each cancellation’s refund amount.\n\nIf a hook throws, the original error propagates. A failed creation saves zero bookings, even when a later group notification fails. A failed cancellation preserves the original booking and its slot. The hook runs synchronously, and booking writes through the same service are blocked during the callback. IDs exposed to a failed hook are retired, and any side effects the hook already performed can still exist.\n\n`run_checks.mjs` exited **0** with all **30 tests passing**. A source scan confirmed that none of the four removed identifiers remain in the benchmark."}}
